# Regenerated by `graphify update .` -- an AST cache, a query stamp and three
# derived reports, all rewritten on every run. Tracked, its churn alone put
# `-dirty` on `harness_commit()`, so every run record and every grade line
# claimed an uncommitted harness whether or not one line of harness code had
# moved. A provenance field that is always set says nothing.
